    "chunk_text": "aldan, & hyt \u00fee Wite gehwa swa he geornor sceal Gode \u00feeowgean & healic f\u00e6stenu f\u00e6stan, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fee geornor deofol wile \u00dey we beoda\u00f0 Godes bebode & eallra his haligra, \u00fe\u00e6t nan \u00feara cristenra manna \u00fee \u00feis gehyre him Men \u00fea leofestan, uton gemunan \u00feone cwide \u00fe\u00e6s eadigan apostolys Petris; he cw\u00e6\u00f0: Se deoful us Uton nu gehealdan georne \u00feis f\u00e6sten, neah \u00feam \u00fee hit awriten is on haligum bocum \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fea f\u00e6ston \u00fee Be \u00f0am is on bocum awriten \u00fe\u00e6t God \u00feurh haligne gast hine het faran to sumere m\u00e6rre ceastre seo Ac for \u00feam \u00fee \u00f0\u00e6t folc w\u00e6s awyrged & \u00e6breca, he him swi\u00f0e ondred & \u00fe\u00e6der faran ne dorste. For \u00f0am \u00fee God w\u00e6s swi\u00f0e yrre \u00fe\u00e6re ceasterleode, \u00f0a wolde he for \u00fei Godes bebodu forfleon. Ac him com to cy\u00f0\u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6t he hie forfleon ne meahte. He \u00feeah on fleame w\u00e6s, o\u00f0 he to sae becwom, & him \u00fe\u00e6r scip gebohte, & mid \u00feam scipmannum him Ac he ne mihte, swa he gemynt h\u00e6fde, Godes willan forfleon. Ac sona swa he w\u00e6s in agan on \u00fe\u00e6t scyp, \u00fea gereste he hine on anum ende, & \u00fea sona swa \u00fea menn \u00dea for \u00feam \u00fea ondredon \u00fea scipmen him swi\u00f0e \u00feearle; hluton him \u00fea betwynan for hwylces hiera & \u00fea behluton hie hit sona to Iona, \u00feam witigan, & he his nan \u00feing nyste. \u00d0a",
